  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "→南無",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0544",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.沒有、不存在。與「有」相對。[例]有頭無尾、獨一無二\n2.不、未。[例]無記名投票\n3.別、不要。[例]碩鼠碩鼠，無食我黍。（《詩經．魏風．碩鼠》）\n4.不論、不管。[例]事無大小，都由他決定。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "6241",
      "verbatim": true
    }
